        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Write a professional research report in clean plain text.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- Do NOT use markdown symbols\n- Do NOT use #, ##, ###, **, ---, or HTML tags\n- Use only normal readable text\n- Keep headings in CAPITAL LETTERS\n- Add blank lines between sections\n- Use bullet points with •\n- Keep formatting clean and professional\n\nStructure:\n\nRESEARCH SUMMARY\n\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY\n\nKEY FINDINGS\n\nIMPORTANT FACTS\n\nCONCLUSION"
